# MRDE Frontend — Development Prompt

## Project Overview

You are building a web frontend for **MRDE (Mission Risk & Decision Engine)** — a real-time satellite risk simulation platform. The backend is a FastAPI server exposing a REST API at a configurable base URL.

The platform monitors 3 satellites, computing 4 risk components (Collision, Weather, Ground Segment, Spacecraft Health) aggregated into a UMRS (Unified Mission Risk Score). A simulation engine ticks forward in time, firing scheduled events (CDMs, eclipses, station outages) that dynamically reorder the priority queue. AI-generated recommendation cards provide operational guidance per risk component.

**Tone:** Professional, serious, minimalist — this is a mission operations tool, not a toy. Think Bloomberg Terminal meets SpaceX mission control.

