## Dashboard — Detailed Behavior

### Header
- Clock updates every time the frontend calls `POST /api/tick`
- Kp badge: shows value + colored indicator (green < 4, yellow < 6, red >= 6)
- Alert count badge: red if > 0, otherwise hidden
- Reset button: calls `POST /api/reset`, refetches everything

### Satellite Selector
- Shows all 3 satellites with their priority number, name, UMRS, and level
- Movement arrows (^/v) appear when a satellite changes position — animate the arrow briefly
- Active satellite is highlighted with accent color
- Can also select via globe click or keyboard 1/2/3

### Risk Bars
- 4 horizontal bars, filled proportionally
- Color: based on the score threshold (CRITICAL=red, HIGH=orange, MODERATE=yellow, LOW=green)
- Numeric value + level label on the right

### Recommendation Cards
- Each card shows component name, time sensitivity badge (colored), confidence badge (colored)
- Headline in bold
- Explanation text in muted color
- Action text prefixed with ">>" in accent color
- Cards are sorted by priority (1..4)

### 24-Hour Forecast Chart
- **Main line:** UMRS across 24 hours (thick, bright accent-blue)
- **4 sub-lines:** collision, health, ground, weather (thinner, each with a distinct muted color — red, cyan, amber, green)
- X-axis: hours 0-23
- Y-axis: 0-100 (risk score)
- Event markers at the top of the chart (vertical lines or small badges at the hour mark)
- Tooltip on hover: shows hour and all 5 values
- Smooth curved lines (monotone cubic interpolation if available)

### Live Events
- Feed of the last 6 events
- Each event shows the sim hour and a description
- New events animate in from the top, old ones slide out

### Auto-Poll Loop
```typescript
useEffect(() => {
  const interval = setInterval(async () => {
    await tickApi({ ticks: 1 });
    const state = await getState();
    if (selectedSat) {
      const dash = await getDashboard(selectedSat);
      updateDashboard(dash, state);
    }
    updateHeader(state);
  }, 2000); // every 2s = 2 sim minutes
  return () => clearInterval(interval);
}, [selectedSat]);
```

## Page Transitions

Every route change / view switch uses smooth transitions:
- **Auth → Dashboard:** Slide up + fade (0.5s spring)
- **Satellite switch:** The globe animation plays, then dashboard data crossfades
- **Modal/settings:** Backdrop blur + slide-up sheet

## Responsiveness

- Desktop-first (1920x1080 target)
- On smaller screens (1366x768):
  - Side-by-side sections stack vertically
  - Globe takes full-width hero section
  - Font sizes adjust down
- On mobile: Globe simplifies to a static badge, chart becomes scrollable horizontally

